# ZumaOS colour scheme, from the Figma design (file LfkRcufG8kmrSS5pYaXuV4):
# #2D2D2D surfaces, #9A9A9A controls with white text, #7B7B7B outlines,
# white for selection with #2D2D2D text. The design has no accent colour.

